            },
            "fieldType": "description",
            "type": "SET",
            "value": "* Please add this to the next Jira Sprint for prioritization, and update the Due date to the end of that Sprint. \n\n* Create an Excel sheet from the Jira Audits folder on our team’s Shared Drive with the date of the audit in the title (eg, 2024-08-04). The Excel sheet should include:\n\n** Link to the General Request at the top\n\n** Columns for:\n\n*** Name\n\n*** Custom Field description\n\n*** Type\n\n*** Values\n\n*** Screens and contexts\n\n*** Number of Projects\n\n*** Project Names\n\n*** Created by (jpolman1, cklein50, rkhatcha, ?…)\n\n*** Created date\n\n*** Last used date\n\n*** Recommendation:\n\n**** Keep (as is)\n\n**** Keep (update name)\n\n**** Keep (update values, include the list of updated values)\n\n**** Delete (replaced by a custom field _________)\n\n**** Delete (Last used date is >30d after the created date)\n\n**** Delete (Last used date is >60d after the created date)\n\n*** Have you reached out to the Project Owner(s) to see if they agree with your Recommendation? (Yes, No because….)\n\n*** What else needs to be updated if we move forward with the Recommendation? (eg, automation, behaviors, …) \n\n*** Next steps (provided by rkhatch@)\n\n** Once the Excel sheet is filled out with your recommendation, please assign the General Request to rkhatcha@ to provide feedback in the Next Steps column. \n\n** Please setup a meeting to review 1 week after assigning it to rkhatcha@. (Note: This will move to the next Jira Sprint if assigned after the first week of the Sprint.)"
          },
